Make the advertised AirPlay device model configurable

Senders derive the AirPlay-picker icon from the advertised model. Retain
BoomPi's general.airplay_device_model setting using upstream's model
field, now shared by Bonjour records and the AirPlay 2 /info response.
The field is owned and freed by shairport-sync.

Rebased for 94070a1d514229b03a1ca202297a20a8993d6d92 (5.6-dev).
Upstream has declined an option for this; carried locally by boompi.

--- a/shairport.c
+++ b/shairport.c
@@ -692,6 +692,12 @@
       if (config_lookup_non_empty_string(config.cfg, "general.name", &str)) {
         raw_service_name = (char *)str;
       }
+      if (config_lookup_non_empty_string(config.cfg, "general.airplay_device_model", &str)) {
+        free(config.model);
+        config.model = strdup(str);
+        if (config.model == NULL)
+          die("Could not allocate the AirPlay device model");
+      }
 #ifdef CONFIG_LIBDAEMON
       /* Get the Daemonize setting. */
       config_set_lookup_bool(config.cfg, "sessioncontrol.daemonize_with_pid_file", &daemonisewith);
